  "title": "Lazy-Jelly Venezuelan Noodles Pilaf",
  "description": "A jammy and glassy-jelly Venezuelan noodle dish made with lamination-puff, perfect for a lazy Sunday. This vegetarian-friendly dish is easy to make and serves well as a lunch or dinner option.",
