  "instructions": [
    "Melt the butter in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the egg noodles and cook for 5 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Pour in the chicken broth, sirloin steak broth concentrate, heavy cream, and carnation evaporated milk.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and let cook for 10-12 minutes or until the noodles are tender.",
    "Stir in the salt and black pepper.",
    "Serve hot and garnish with chopped fresh parsley if desired."
